@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Order - Checkout Order

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Customer|
start
note right
Precondition:
The customer is signed in.

Postcondition:
A PENDING order exists with snapshot prices, stock and
the voucher use are consumed, a payment is created and
the bought lines leave the cart. With VNPAY the response
has a payment URL and the order must be paid within 24
hours.
end note
:Choose cart lines and go to checkout;
|System|
:Display the products and the form;
|Customer|
:Choose the saved address or enter another, choose COD or VNPAY and enter a voucher code if any;
:Submit the order;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Customer|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the lines are the customer's, the products are listed, and decrease each stock;
if (A line is invalid, a product is hidden or short of stock?) then (Yes)
  :Roll everything back and return the checkout error;
  |Customer|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check and consume one voucher use if any;
if (The voucher is unknown, out of validity or used up?) then (Yes)
  :Roll everything back and return the voucher error;
  |Customer|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Create the order with snapshot prices and compute the discounted total (shipping fee 0);
:Create the COD payment, or the VNPAY payment with its URL;
:Remove the bought lines from the cart and return the order;
|Customer|
:View the created order;
stop

@enduml
